load @/code/vibe/tone
  find tone

# The site, one of the twenty-four directions out of a dock, the third base element. Each site points out through one face to the neighbor on the other side, and one tone lives at each site. The twenty-four sites pair into twelve lines, and the line, not the single site, is what the law acts on.
form site
  link tone, like tone

# The site, proof-checked by `seed test`: one of the twenty-four directions out of a dock, the sites pairing into the
# twelve lines the law acts on, 24 = 2 * 12.
hold <the twenty-four sites pair into twelve lines>
  call is-equal
    code 24
    call multiply
      code 2
      code 12
